case frcp-civil-case
uses frcp-civil-procedure ^2024.12.0
as_of 2024-12-01
summary "A civil action under the FRCP: plaintiff sues in federal court, tests personal/subject-matter jurisdiction and service, and litigates through summary judgment and appeal."
notes "Generic FRCP civil case (e.g. an illustrative breach-of-contract-style claim seeking $500,000), self = plaintiff. Uses `frcp-civil-procedure` alone. The matter's outcome stakes below value plaintiff wins at $500,000 and plaintiff losses at $0; the package carries judgment direction with the `judgment-for-defendant` state flag through trial and appeal and splits the win/loss outcomes identified by its rules. A summary-judgment grant is for the movant under FRCP 56(a); the discovery-close decision models either party's motion without assigning a probability to who moves. Appeal-window edges follow the losing party and cross-appeal edges the winning party. The reversal/remand terminal remains a $250,000 interim remand value because the chart does not model what judgment follows the mandate. Post-dismissal branches carry neutral $0 values in this generic fixture because it does not specify claim-specific cost awards or fee entitlement; override these values for a real matter. Rate $650/hr blended partner/associate estimate (illustrative, not sourced)."
// Nothing has happened yet: the matter sits at the package start
// (`pre-filing`), so there are no events. Both party actors are represented
// so the package can check winner-relative appeal moves.
perspective plaintiff

parties {
  plaintiff: applicant Corporation
  defendant: examiner Corporation
}

stakes {
  frcp-civil-procedure::service-window-blown: 0.usd
  frcp-civil-procedure::remand-ordered: 0.usd
  frcp-civil-procedure::dismissed-with-prejudice: 0.usd
  frcp-civil-procedure::default-judgment-entered: 500_000.usd
  frcp-civil-procedure::voluntary-dismissal-final: 0.usd
  frcp-civil-procedure::rule60-denial-final: 0.usd
  frcp-civil-procedure::rule41d-costs-ordered: 0.usd
  frcp-civil-procedure::refiling-proceeds: 0.usd
  frcp-civil-procedure::dismissal-fees-eligible: 0.usd
  frcp-civil-procedure::dismissal-fees-ineligible: 0.usd
  frcp-civil-procedure::discovery-sanctions-dismissal: 0.usd
  frcp-civil-procedure::discovery-sanctions-default: 500_000.usd
  frcp-civil-procedure::summary-judgment-for-plaintiff: 0.usd
  frcp-civil-procedure::summary-judgment-for-defendant: 0.usd
  frcp-civil-procedure::appeal-window-blown-plaintiff-judgment: 0.usd
  frcp-civil-procedure::appeal-window-blown-defendant-judgment: 0.usd
  frcp-civil-procedure::judgment-final-no-appeal-plaintiff: 0.usd
  frcp-civil-procedure::judgment-final-no-appeal-defendant: 0.usd
  frcp-civil-procedure::judgment-affirmed-plaintiff: 0.usd
  frcp-civil-procedure::judgment-affirmed-defendant: 0.usd
  frcp-civil-procedure::judgment-reversed-remanded: 250_000.usd
}

analysis { params: { rate: 650.usd / 1.hours, opp_rate: 550.usd / 1.hours } }
